       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLMAIN.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NUM1 PIC 9(3) VALUE 10.
       01 WS-NUM2 PIC 9(3) VALUE 20.
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-STRING PIC X(20) VALUE 'HELLO'.
       01 WS-CODE PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           CALL 'ADDSUB' USING BY REFERENCE WS-NUM1 WS-NUM2 WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY 'RESULT ' WS-RESULT.

           CALL 'ADDSUB' USING BY CONTENT WS-NUM1 BY REFERENCE WS-RESULT.
           DISPLAY 'RESULT2 ' WS-RESULT.

           CALL 'STRINGPROG' USING BY REFERENCE WS-STRING.
           DISPLAY WS-STRING.

           MOVE RETURN-CODE TO WS-CODE.
           DISPLAY 'RETURN CODE ' WS-CODE.
           STOP RUN.
